{"words": [{"text": "وَءَامِنُوا۟", "translation": "And believe"}, {"text": "بِمَآ", "translation": "in what"}, {"text": "أَنزَلْتُ", "translation": "I have sent down"}, {"text": "مُصَدِّقًۭا", "translation": "confirming"}, {"text": "لِّمَا", "translation": "that which"}, {"text": "مَعَكُمْ", "translation": "(is) with you"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and (do) not"}, {"text": "تَكُونُوٓا۟", "translation": "be"}, {"text": "أَوَّلَ", "translation": "(the) first"}, {"text": "كَافِرٍۭ", "translation": "disbeliever"}, {"text": "بِهِۦ ۖ", "translation": "of it"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تَشْتَرُوا۟", "translation": "exchange"}, {"text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِى", "translation": "My Signs (for)"}, {"text": "ثَمَنًۭا", "translation": "a price"}, {"text": "قَلِيلًۭا", "translation": "small"}, {"text": "وَإِيَّـٰىَ", "translation": "and Me Alone"}, {"text": "فَٱتَّقُونِ", "translation": "fear [Me]"}], "sahih": "And believe in what I have sent down confirming that which is [already] with you, and be not the first to disbelieve in it. And do not exchange My signs for a small price, and fear [only] Me."}